# APT31 Judgement Panda Activity | T1003.001, T1560.001 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules-emerging-threats/2019/TA/APT31/proc_creation_win_apt_apt31_judgement_panda.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1 ((CommandLine="*ldifde*" CommandLine="*-f -n*" CommandLine="*eprod.ldf*") OR (CommandLine="*copy \\\\*" CommandLine="*c$*" (CommandLine IN ("*\\aaaa\\procdump64.exe*", "*\\aaaa\\netsess.exe*", "*\\aaaa\\7za.exe*", "*\\c$\\aaaa\\*"))))
